sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Admin browser
  participant F as api/admin.js
  participant C as Cloudinary
  A->>A: prepareFile: shrink to 10 MB and 25 MP (canvas to WebP)
  A->>F: POST gallery/sign
  F-->>A: timestamp, folder, preset, tags, SHA-1 signature
  A->>C: POST file + signature (XHR with progress)
  C-->>A: public_id, version, signature
  A->>F: POST gallery with publicId, version, signature, credit
  F->>F: verifyUploadResponse
  F->>C: Admin API getResource
  alt too big, wrong format or folder
    F->>C: destroy
    F-->>A: 422 UPLOAD_REJECTED
  else ok
    F->>F: insert gallery_images + activity_log
    F-->>A: 201 item
  end
